{"unit_id":"sfyyy__dsh-vision-bridge#card-zh","repo":"sfyyy/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"3d00656398d2a146ae698944756ae4d5ec71d9fb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-extension/dsh-vision-bridge 是面向 DSH Web 的视觉桥接插件，为纯文本会话按需提供图片理解。它在消息进入 agent 时记录图片附件，并将发给文本模型的图片块替换成带附件 ID 的文字标记；会话日志和界面仍保留原图。模型可调用 vision_describe 分析当前会话附件或本地图片，支持一次询问最多四张图片并返回文字答案，也可比较多图。插件同时提供设置页、图片准入绕过和独立的 vision-bridge 模型路由。需要配置 OpenAI-compatible 视觉端点及 API key 或其环境变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:43-44","lib/index.js:228-239","lib/index.js:538-631","lib/client.js:133-145"]}
{"unit_id":"sfyyy__dsh-vision-bridge#card-en","repo":"sfyyy/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"3d00656398d2a146ae698944756ae4d5ec71d9fb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@dsh-extension/dsh-vision-bridge gives DSH Web on-demand image analysis. The text model receives image markers while the session keeps originals. It calls vision_describe to ask about or compare up to four session images or local files and gets text. Configure a compatible vision endpoint.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:43-44","lib/index.js:228-239","lib/index.js:538-631","lib/client.js:133-145"]}
