{"unit_id":"sfyyy__dsh-vision-bridge#feature-1","repo":"sfyyy/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"3d00656398d2a146ae698944756ae4d5ec71d9fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-extension/dsh-vision-bridge 的功能「按需看图」：文本模型可调用 vision_describe，传入会话图片附件 ID 或本地图片路径及问题，获得视觉模型的文字回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:538-545","lib/index.js:571-629"]}
{"unit_id":"sfyyy__dsh-vision-bridge#feature-2","repo":"sfyyy/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"3d00656398d2a146ae698944756ae4d5ec71d9fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-extension/dsh-vision-bridge 的功能「图片标记改写」：会话派生给文本模型的消息中，图片块会被替换为提示文字和附件 ID，原始会话内容保持不变。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:228-239","lib/index.js:247-254","lib/index.js:740-770"]}
{"unit_id":"sfyyy__dsh-vision-bridge#feature-3","repo":"sfyyy/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"3d00656398d2a146ae698944756ae4d5ec71d9fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-extension/dsh-vision-bridge 的功能「多图提问」：调用 vision_describe 时可组合会话附件和本地路径，一次提交一至四张图片及一个问题，支持比较图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:575-599"]}
{"unit_id":"sfyyy__dsh-vision-bridge#feature-4","repo":"sfyyy/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"3d00656398d2a146ae698944756ae4d5ec71d9fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-extension/dsh-vision-bridge 的功能「视觉模型配置」：在 Web 设置页填写端点、API key 和模型名称并保存，后端维护专用的视觉模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:102-126","lib/index.js:305-337","lib/index.js:382-432"]}
{"unit_id":"sfyyy__dsh-vision-bridge#feature-5","repo":"sfyyy/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"3d00656398d2a146ae698944756ae4d5ec71d9fb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-extension/dsh-vision-bridge 的功能「图片准入」：插件启用时扩展模型能力信息中的图片模态，让 Web 会话接收图片；关闭或卸载后会恢复原解析函数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:435-480"]}
{"unit_id":"sfyyy__dsh-vision-bridge#caveat-1","repo":"sfyyy/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"3d00656398d2a146ae698944756ae4d5ec71d9fb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-extension/dsh-vision-bridge 使用前须知：视觉调用会把所选图片和问题发送到配置的视觉模型服务；插件构造请求时只放入图片块与问题，不包含会话历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:584-612"]}
{"unit_id":"sfyyy__dsh-vision-bridge#caveat-2","repo":"sfyyy/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"3d00656398d2a146ae698944756ae4d5ec71d9fb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@dsh-extension/dsh-vision-bridge 使用前须知：需要提供视觉服务 API key 或其环境变量名；在设置页直接填写的 key 会同步到 DSH credential store。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:313-319"]}
